.TH "libnvme" 9 "enum nvme_lockdown_cfi_desc_cfia" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
enum nvme_lockdown_cfi_desc_cfia \- Command and Feature Identifier Descriptor - Command and Feature Identifier Attributes (CFIA)
.SH SYNOPSIS
enum nvme_lockdown_cfi_desc_cfia {
.br
.BI "    NVME_LOCKDOWN_CFI_DESC_CFIA_ACNTL"

};
.SH Constants
.IP "NVME_LOCKDOWN_CFI_DESC_CFIA_ACNTL" 12
All Controllers: if set, then \fIcfi\fP is
reported by all controllers in the NVM
subsystem; if cleared, then \fIcfi\fP is
reported by at least one but not all
controllers in the NVM subsystem.
